sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor D as Driver
  participant A as Vehicle agent
  participant L as Fast-route classifier
  participant G as Allow(q)
  participant P as Planner (larger model)
  D->>A: question
  A->>L: classify (~130 ms warm)
  alt one reading answers it
    L-->>A: route = read X
    A->>G: read X
    G-->>A: value
    A-->>D: answer from a template — no language model
  else it needs reasoning
    A->>P: plan, constrained to a strict schema
    P-->>A: steps
    loop every step re-enters the gate
      A->>G: step
    end
    A-->>D: answer with its evidence
  else larger model unreachable
    A-->>D: model-free answer, or an honest "I can't answer that now"
  end
